      {
        "id": "M003",
        "kind": "mathlib",
        "statement": "Let Z be a finite-dimensional real normed vector space with its Borel measurable structure, μ an additive Haar measure on Z, κ a normed field with a normed real algebra structure, f,g:Z→κ and v∈Z. If (Df(·)v)g, f(Dg(·)v), and fg are μ-integrable, f is real differentiable at every point of tsupport g, and g is real differentiable at every point of tsupport f, then ∫ f(x)(Dg(x)v) dμ(x)=−∫ (Df(x)v)g(x) dμ(x).",
